From ed152e34628b5caa6d760da113a4f6189251ebb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Karthikeyan K <karthikk@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 09 Mar 2022 04:09:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-76435] rom : port boot info apis to rom

Ported boot info apis from preboot to rom. Boot info in rom is used
to store image descriptor and security data on sp sram which can be
reused by other components in the future.

Change-Id: I2efc6cc59eafb901c46907f53a6a36cd0a03ae03
---

